  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NRC Sudan 2022-26 - NRC Sudan CASPIR project</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">NRC Sudan 2022-26</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the CASPIR project is improved peaceful, sustainable, and dignified living conditions for displacement-affected communities as result of enhanced, diversified, and more adaptable livelihoods productivity, enhanced financial inclusion and strengthened market systems.


The specific outcome objectives are: 

Outcome 1: Support pathways towards sustainable peace through a more inclusive, community centred process with greater participation of women.; and

Outcome 2: Support to agriculture production systems through sustainable and diversified practices to foster increased production, food security, and access to markets.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Det &#xF6;vergripande m&#xE5;let med interventionen &#xE4;r att fr&#xE4;mja s&#xE4;kra, h&#xE5;llbara och v&#xE4;rdiga levnadsvillkor f&#xF6;r f&#xF6;rdrivna m&#xE4;nniskor i konfliktdrabbade omr&#xE5;den. Projektet syftar till att st&#xE4;rka anv&#xE4;ndandet av landtillg&#xE5;ngar och samtidigt st&#xE4;rka samh&#xE4;lles m&#xF6;jligheter att anv&#xE4;nda land f&#xF6;r inkomstbringande aktiviteter. Projektet avses implementeras i delstaterna S&#xF6;dra Kordofan och White Nile.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the intervention is to foster safe, sustainable, and dignified living conditions for displacement-affected communities prone to conflict over natural resources and due to inadequate adaptable and diversified livelihood options resulting in additional barrier in accessing basic services. The project will be implemented in South Kordofan State and White Nile State.</narrative>
  </description>
